5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. I believe the key to this game is patient observation and careful listening. Let us all try to remain calm and logical as we uncover the truth together.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree, Jonathan. Logic and observation are our best tools here. I intend to analyze everyone's contradictions carefully to ensure we don't make any hasty mistakes. Let's see who among us is hiding something.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm so excited to play! I don't know much about logic, but I'll use my intuition to find the werewolf! Let's make this a big adventure and catch the bad guy together!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with the need for logic. I will focus on the consistency of everyone's statements and how they align with their behavior. Let's proceed carefully.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A most promising start. While intuition has its charms, Rin, I suspect we shall find that a cold, analytical approach serves us better. I look forward to seeing whose logic holds firm under pressure.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"The Seer's role is vital for providing clarity, while the Werewolf will likely try to sow confusion. I hope we can trust the information that emerges and avoid unnecessary conflict.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Indeed. However, we must remember that the Werewolf will likely mimic the Seer's confidence to mislead us. We should be cautious about who we trust and scrutinize every claim for logical gaps.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,"If the Werewolf is pretending to be the Seer, that's like a secret spy! That's so cool! I'll just watch everyone's faces and see who looks the most suspicious!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,The Possessed is also a factor. They will likely support the Werewolf's lies to create a false consensus. We must be mindful of who is defending whom too eagerly.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A keen observation, Misaki. The Possessed is indeed a subtle shadow in this game. I wonder, though, if ""eager defense"" is the only tell, or if a quiet, logical agreement is more dangerous.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,It is true that silence can be as telling as noise. I believe we should all be mindful of how we react to new information as the days progress.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. Silence can be a shield for the guilty or a sign of careful thought for the innocent. I will be paying close attention to the timing and nature of everyone's responses.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,"I'll be watching too! If someone is being too quiet or acting weird, I'll point it out right away! I bet my tummy will tell me who the werewolf is!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"Intuition has its place, Rin, but we should prioritize evidence. I'll be comparing the timing of claims with the reactions they provoke to see if anyone is trying too hard to steer the conversation.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Evidence is a fickle thing in a game of masks, Misaki. I suspect we shall find that the most ""consistent"" stories are often the ones most carefully crafted. Let us see who manages to stay perfectly in character.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Let us keep our minds open and our hearts steady. I look forward to seeing how the first night unfolds and what truths may come to light tomorrow. Until then, let us remain peaceful.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I concur. Let us maintain our composure. I will be observing each of you closely to see whose logic remains consistent when the pressure mounts. I'm ready for the first night.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Rin,,"Me too! I'm ready for the adventure to start! I hope the Seer finds something super exciting tonight! Good luck everyone, see you tomorrow!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"I will continue to observe and analyze. Let us hope for a clear lead tomorrow. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,A delightful introduction for all. I shall retire to my thoughts and await the morning with anticipation. May the night be as illuminating for some as it is concealing for others. Good night.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
